# Demo Web UI opens in Cursor

When a Sandbox demo Web UI first comes up (`scaffold_demo_stage.py`, `docker compose --profile stage`, or `full`):

1. **Do not** run macOS `open http://…`, `open -a "Google Chrome"`, or any other host browser.
2. Open it in **Cursor's IDE browser**: MCP `cursor-ide-browser` → `browser_navigate` with `position: "active"` (the user wants to see it here).
3. Still paste Local + LAN URLs in chat and on the Info tab Access list.

`tools/scaffold_demo_stage.py` prints the URL only — it must not launch Chrome.
